<string_table>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_bio"><text>An experienced stalker and weapons dealer who settled at Yanov station.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_hello"><text>Hello.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_intro_actor_1"><text>Good day. Don't you get bored here?</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_intro_npc_1"><text>Hard to say... There are fewer people around, and fewer orders too. Even if I had any, I couldn't deliver them. Maybe it is time I moved somewhere less quiet.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_intro_actor_2"><text>You mentioned orders. What kind of orders?</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_intro_npc_2"><text>You know: weapons, equipment, things you cannot just find lying around. Though right now even I would not be able to find them.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_intro_actor_3"><text>So I cannot order equipment from you now, is that right?</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_intro_npc_3"><text>Not for now. My UAZ broke down, and I am stuck here. Nitro says he cannot help; I need a specialist mechanic. I do not want to abandon my girl here. We have been through a lot together.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_intro_actor_4"><text>What if I bought the vehicle from you?</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_intro_npc_4"><text>You are a quick one, never short of an offer. Sorry, but no. She means too much to me. If you need a vehicle, though, I might be able to help. I spotted a few wrecks while roaming the city. Some may still run. And if you decide to take one and need fuel, I may be able to spare a canister if there is any left over.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_intro_actor_5"><text>I will think about it.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_intro_end"><text>Think it over. Come back if you need anything.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_fuel_order_actor"><text>Do you have any fuel for sale?</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_fuel_order_npc"><text>I have one spare canister. I only sell what is left after Yanov's needs are covered. Twenty litres will cost you 6,000 rubles.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_fuel_order_accept_actor"><text>I'll take it. Here is 6,000.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_fuel_order_lack_money_actor"><text>I do not have enough money yet.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_fuel_order_decline_actor"><text>Not right now, I was just asking.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_fuel_order_accept_npc"><text>Deal. Here is your canister.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_fuel_order_wait_npc"><text>No problem. Come back when you have the money.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_fuel_order_decline_npc"><text>All right. Come back if you need it.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_fuel_sale_cooldown_npc"><text>Nothing spare right now. Everything I have is needed at Yanov. Check back later.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_fuel_collect_actor"><text>I am here for the canister. Is the order ready?</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_fuel_collect_npc"><text>It is. Here you go: twenty litres, as promised.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_fuel_order_ready_tip"><text>I am back. You can come and collect your order.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_vehicle_catalog_actor"><text>You mentioned those vehicles...</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_vehicle_catalog_npc"><text>Yes, I saw plenty. They seemed to be in decent shape. What kind interests you?</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_vehicle_category_light"><text>Light vehicles.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_vehicle_category_offroad"><text>Off-road vehicles.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_vehicle_category_heavy"><text>Trucks.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_vehicle_category_prompt"><text>What other kind interests you?</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_vehicle_list_prompt"><text>Which one caught your eye?</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_vehicle_back_categories"><text>Back to the categories.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_yanov_nimble_vehicle_back_main"><text>Let us talk about something else.</text></string>
